WEBVTT

00:00:00.407 --> 00:00:05.910
In this video, you will send a sponsor one private link, then review their request and approve it.

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:06.894
We start on the map.

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.524
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.399 --> 00:00:14.949
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:17.646
Then tap Allow.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.890
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.670
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.233
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:32.934
Tap it.

00:00:34.503 --> 00:00:36.466
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:42.202
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:42.202 --> 00:00:43.059
Tap Mine.

00:00:45.021 --> 00:00:46.991
This is your personal page.

00:00:46.991 --> 00:00:52.461
It lists the contests you run, if you run any, and the homes you entered, with their status.

00:00:52.461 --> 00:00:54.569
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:56.362 --> 00:01:00.466
This opens your dashboard, the control room for your contest.

00:01:00.466 --> 00:01:01.526
Tap Sponsors.

00:01:04.291 --> 00:01:06.508
First, tell sponsors how to pay you.

00:01:06.508 --> 00:01:09.620
Paste your own payment link, or write where to send a check.

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:10.503
Tap Save.

00:01:13.714 --> 00:01:15.573
Next, Invite a sponsor.

00:01:15.573 --> 00:01:18.591
This works once your contest is live and approved.

00:01:18.591 --> 00:01:20.114
Tap Create invite link.

00:01:21.876 --> 00:01:23.398
This is your private link.

00:01:23.398 --> 00:01:25.926
Tap Copy link, then send it to the sponsor.

00:01:27.811 --> 00:01:29.473
Now the sponsor's side.

00:01:29.473 --> 00:01:32.659
They open your link, no account needed, and see how to pay you.

00:01:33.433 --> 00:01:36.727
They fill in a short form, and tap Send to the organizer.

00:01:44.177 --> 00:01:46.719
Back on your side, the request waits for you.

00:01:46.719 --> 00:01:48.575
Nothing shows until you approve it.

00:01:50.318 --> 00:01:53.030
Once they have paid you, tap Mark payment received.

00:01:54.716 --> 00:01:59.446
Choose Paid to me, tick that you collected it, add the date, then tap Save sponsor.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.235
Now tap Approve.

00:02:07.299 --> 00:02:10.583
The sponsor appears on your contest page, labelled Sponsor.

00:02:11.443 --> 00:02:14.385
Next up: Presenting installer and quote requests.
